On Tue, Sep 19, 2006 at 04:36:58PM -0400, Michael Turniansky wrote:
> 
> 
> Michael wrote:
> 
> >
> >.i mi cpedu lenu mi penmi le la lojban. tavla
> > 
> 
> Does this parse properly 

Yes.

> without a ku after lojban because "tavla" can't be part of a
> cmevla sequence? (i.e. if we had said ".. le le lojbo tavla" that
> wouldn't be grammatical, we'd need "le le lojbo ku tavla")

Correct, but you can't have ".lojban. tavla" as anything but a cmene
followed by a brivla; there's no way to merge those as written into
one thing, the way "lojbo tavla" can be.

